From cdbeaad79974d0698bd34f52c9a03a5b80eb6fce Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mitch Johnston <mitch.johnston25@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 21:07:20 +1030
Subject: [PATCH] qt: onboarding in place of the first run wizard

First run now opens the design's onboarding in the main window instead of VLC's wizard: a welcome with a media folder for the library (the user's Videos folder by default, with Browse), the theme and accent color applied as they are picked, and the basic keyboard shortcuts drawn as keycaps from VLC's actual hotkeys. Finish adds the folder to the media library and turns off the first run; the metadata network access question the old wizard asked is left to Settings > Privacy. The accent swatches in Settings now use the same nine colors as the design's onboarding.
---
 modules/gui/qt/Makefile.am                    |   1 +
 .../gui/qt/dialogs/dialogs/qml/Onboarding.qml | 553 ++++++++++++++++++
 .../qt/dialogs/dialogs/qml/SettingsRow.qml    |  20 +-
 modules/gui/qt/dialogs/dialogs_provider.cpp   |   5 +
 modules/gui/qt/dialogs/dialogs_provider.hpp   |   2 +
 .../qt/dialogs/preferences/vlc_settings.cpp   |  31 +
 .../qt/dialogs/preferences/vlc_settings.hpp   |   7 +
 .../qt/maininterface/qml/MainInterface.qml    |  29 +
 modules/gui/qt/meson.build                    |   1 +
 9 files changed, 640 insertions(+), 9 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 modules/gui/qt/dialogs/dialogs/qml/Onboarding.qml

diff --git a/modules/gui/qt/Makefile.am b/modules/gui/qt/Makefile.am
